        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.svgrenderer"
      ],
      "section": "key_capabilities",
      "slot": "capability:2",
      "text": "Render a Barcode instance to vector or raster formats by invoking to_svg to produce an SVG string or to_png to produce PNG bytes, using SvgRenderer and PngRenderer internally."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "example:005",
        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.renderoptions"
      ],
      "section": "key_capabilities",
      "slot": "capability:3",
      "text": "Adjust rendering behavior such as scale, DPI, module width, and text visibility by passing a RenderOptions instance to the to_png or to_svg methods."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "example:003",
        "example:004",
