      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "The aspose-barcode-foss package provides barcode generation and rendering capabilities through the aspose_barcode_foss.Barcode class, which serves as the central interface for working with barcodes. This class is returned by the generate() function and all per-symbology helpers, and exposes methods to render barcodes to PNG, SVG, or PDF formats."
